from new funding sources. In Scenario A, Person 3 is the most recently hired collaborative biostatistician. Since Person 3's project-based funding
has grown to 0.5 FTE, this signals to the unit that it is time to start hiring for the next position. Note that in Scenario A, Person 3 still has 0.3 FTE
remaining for temporary flexible funding time. This allows for the potentially lengthy process of hiring, onboarding, and training Person 4 to be
completed before Person 4 is needed on a new project. If a new grant or contract comes in during this time, Person 3 still has some temporary
