3.2 | Team culture and dynamics
A major theme that emerged from the interviews was the relationship between flexible funding and team culture/dynamics. Participants noted
that flexible funding allows for activities to take place that strengthen connections between collaborative biostatisticians within the unit, rather
than each collaborative biostatistician having time only for their own separate research projects. One participant mentioned that ‘[flexible
funding] actually contributes to the culture of the team to turn it into what I would call a true team. It's not just a loose confederation of people
who happen to be in the same place at the same time doing the same thing’.
